          <section class="section" id="finished">
            <div class="complete-card">
              <div class="section-label">Finished</div>
              <h2>Windows 11 is ready to use</h2>

              <p>
                You now have a clean Windows 11 installation using a local
                offline profile. The computer can still access Windows Update,
                install normal programs, and connect to the internet without
                converting the Windows login into a Microsoft account.
              </p>
